<view class="page theme-{{theme}} templates-page">
  <view class="page-top">
    <view class="row between">
      <view>
        <view class="h1">训练模板</view>
        <view class="muted small mt-8">固定动作和目标，重量交给渐进建议。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="template-count">{{count}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{templates.length}}" class="template-list mt-24">
    <view wx:for="{{templates}}" wx:key="id" class="card template-card">
      <view class="row between">
        <view class="grow">
          <view class="template-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="muted tiny mt-8">{{item.metaLabel}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="template-action-count">{{item.exerciseCount}} 动作</view>
      </view>

      <view class="template-preview mt-12">{{item.preview}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="template-note mt-8">{{item.note}}</view>

      <view class="template-actions mt-16">
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm grow" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="startTemplate">开始训练</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editTemplate">编辑</button>
        <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeTemplate">删除</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="empty mt-24">
    <view class="empty-title">还没有训练模板</view>
    <view class="empty-desc">把常练动作和目标组数存成模板，下次直接开始。</view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block mt-24" bindtap="createTemplate">＋ 新建模板</button>
  <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block mt-12" bindtap="saveLastWorkout">
    {{lastWorkoutName ? '把“' + lastWorkoutName + '”存为模板' : '把上次训练存为模板'}}
  </button>

  <view class="template-tip mt-24">
    模板不会锁定重量。训练中会根据该动作最近记录给出加重、维持或减重建议，你可以一键采用或手动调整。
  </view>
</view>
